  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "Just get this over with. I don\u2019t have all day. "
    doctorResponsePositive: "I\u2019ll be as efficient as possible while making sure
      we check everything."
    patientReactionPositive: Good. While you're at it, I noticed some [symptoms]
