  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "I doubt you\u2019ll actually fix anything, but whatever. "
    doctorResponsePositive: "I\u2019ll do my best to find a solution for you."
    patientReactionPositive: Finally, someone who's willing to do their job. Lately,
